{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：01:21 2026-10-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：01:21 2026-10-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：01:21 2026-10-23 HKT</p><img alt=\"快過打針｜Moderna獲利回吐 股價單日急插兩成 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl_square/43751d71aceb1d55be0c5644a000af37/2026-10/moderna_1200x676_0.jpg\"/><p>美國生物科技公司Moderna（MRNA）周四盤中股價急挫逾20%，一度跌至183.5美元，較周三的52周高位254美元大幅回落，成為市場焦點。</p><p>Moderna股價近期累積龐大升幅，主要受市場憧憬公司與默沙東（MRK）合作開發的個人化癌症疫苗前景帶動。不過，隨着股價急升，市場對其估值及未來臨床試驗結果的關注亦有所增加，部分投資者趁高獲利。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:40:38.320517+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":253,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T17:21:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T20:58:09.160371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:38:19.330527+00:00","content_hash":"ad12122ee9f0ca5c0912e2b5faaa8a12f5449b39daa51253e24808586813ec01","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}